+# To-do app
+
+Static page (`index.html`) with no build step or server. Tasks persist in `localStorage` under key `todos` as `[{id, text, done}]`; add, toggle, delete, and reload behavior all read and write that one key.
+
+## Filters
+
+`filters.js` defines the filter names and the `filterTodos(todos, filter)` mapping once, shared by the page (via `TodoFilters` global) and the tests (via CommonJS export).
+
+- `all` — every task (default on load)
+- `active` — `!done`
+- `completed` — `done`
+
+The selected filter lives in memory only, so reload returns to `all` while tasks are preserved. Filter buttons expose state through `aria-pressed`.
+
+## Checks
+
+Run `pnpm test` (or `node --test tests/`). No dependencies.
+
+- `tests/filters.test.js` — unit tests for `filterTodos`: each filter, empty input, unknown filter, no mutation, object identity, and saved shape.
+- `tests/e2e.test.js` — drives the real page in headless Google Chrome over the DevTools Protocol: add, toggle, delete, filter switching, live removal when toggling out of `active`, reload persistence, and desktop/mobile screenshot capture into `tests/screenshots/`.
+
+Last verified: `pnpm test` passed 18 tests (9 unit + 9 E2E); desktop and mobile screenshots reviewed with filters visible above the fold and correct pressed state.
